  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\n\nIn the Launch Pad Tab of the Main Menu you have a list of `Recently Visited Online Friends` and `Recently Played` players. The sorting on the Launch Pad it self seems to be fine, but when clicking on the `+[number]` the sorting is broken.\n\nEven though it shows `Last Visited` selected at the top right, it's not actually showing the last visited person first etc.\n\nTo get it to sort correctly you first need to set it to something else, e.g. `Name` and then back to `last Visited`.\n\n# Expected Behavior:\n\nSorting should work correctly and it should use `Last Visited` by default, so it matches with the Launch Pad it self.\n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere is a video showcasing the issue:\n\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/3ndz8j.mp4",
